{
  "title": "Dua-e-Sabaah",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\nاَللّٰہُمَّ یَا مَنْ دَلَعَ لِسَانَ الصَّبَاحِ بِنُطْقِ تَبَلُّجِہٖ \nALLAAHUMMA YAA MAN DALA-A’ LESAANAS SABAAHE BE-NUTQE TABALLOJEHI \nO Allah! O He Who makes dawn express itself in the first appearance of light \nوَ سَرَّحَ قِطَعَ اللَّیْلِ الْمُظْلِمِ بِغَیَاہِیْبِ تَلَجْلُجِہٖ \nWA SARRAJA QETA-A’L LAYLIL MUZLEME BE-GHAYAAHEEBE TALAJLOJEHI \ndrives off the dying night alongwith its gloomy, obscurities, \nوَ اَتْقَنَ صُنْعَ الْفَلَكِ الدَّوَّارِ فِیْ مَقَادِیْرِ تَبَرُّجِہٖ \nWA ATQANA SUN-A’L FALAKID DAWWAARE FEE MAQAADEERE TABARROJEHI \nestablished firmly the artistry of celestial rotation within its zodiacal bounds \nوَ شَعْشَعَ ضِیَآءَ الشَّمْسِ بِنُوْرِ تَاَجُّجِہٖ یَا مَنْ دَلَّ عَلٰی ذَاتِہٖ بِذَاتِہٖ \nWA SHA’SHA-A’ ZEYAAA-ASH SHAMSE BENOORE TA-AJJOJEHI YAA MAN DALLA A’LAA ZAATEHI BE-ZAATEHI \nand illuminated the shimmering splendor of the sun with its diffusing light. O He, Who brings forth His (own) being as a proof of His entity \nوَ تَنَزَّہَ عَنْ مُجَانَسَۃِ مَخْلُوْقَاتِہٖ وَ جَلَّ عَنْ مُّلاَئَمَۃِ كَیْفِیَّاتِہٖ \nWA TANAZZAHA A’N MOJAANASATEHI MAKHLOOQAATEHI WA JALLA A’M MOLAA-AMATE KAYFIYYAATEHI \nand is free from any likeness to the created beings, and. because of His singularities, is exalted beyond comparability. \nیَا مَنْ قَرُبَ مِنْ خَطَرَاتِ الظُّنُوْنِ وَ بَعُدَ عَنْ لَحَظَاتِ الْعُیُوْنِ \nYAA MAN QAROBA MIN KHATARAATIZ ZONOONE WA BA-O’DA A’N LAHAZAATIL O’YOONE \nO He Who is near to the con templative power of mind. Dut unperceivable to the faculty of seeing \nوَ عَلِمَ بِمَا كَانَ قَبْلَ اَنْ یَّكُوْنَ یَا مَنْ اَرْقَدَنِيْ فِيْ مِہَادِ اَمْنِہٖ \nWA A’LEMA BEMAA KAANA QABLA AYN YAAKOONA YAA MAN ARQADANEE FEE MEHAADE AMNEHI \nand knows in advance the course of events. O He Who put me at rest under His peaceful sanctuary arid blessed me with favours \nوَ اَمَانِہٖ وَ اَیْقَظَنِيْ اِلٰی مَا مَنَحَنِی بِہٖ مِنْ مِنَنِہٖ وَ اِحْسَانِہٖ \nWA AMAANEHI WA AYQAZANEE ELAA MAA MANAHANEE BEHI MIN MENANEHI WA EHSAANEHI \nand bounties when I got up; and with His power \nوَ كَفَّ اَكُفَّ السُّوْءِ عَنِّیْ بِیَدِہٖ وَ سُلْطَانِہٖ \nWA KAFFA AKUFFAS SOO-E A’NNEE BEYADEHI WA SULTAANEHI \nand might cut short the evil hands, advancing towards me, \nصَلِّ اللّٰہُمَّ عَلَیْ الدَّلِیْلِ اِلَیْكَ فِيْ اللَّیْلِ الْاَلْیَلِ \nSALLIL LAAHUMMA A’LAD DALEELE ELAYKA FIL LAYLIL ALYAL \nO Allah! Bless him, who, in the darkest hours of heathen obscurity, \nوَ الْمَاسِكِ مِنْ اَسْبَابِكَ بِحَبْلِ الشَّرَفِ الْاَطْوَلِ \nWAL MAASEKE MIN ASBAABEKA BEHABLISH-SHARAFIL ATWALE \nshowed the right way, interwoven in the cord of the nobility of Thy far-reaching ropes, \nوَ النَّاصِعِ الْحَسَبِ فِيْ ذَرْوَۃِ الكَاہِلِ الاَعْبَلِ \nWAN NAASEHIL HASABE FEE ZARWATIL KAAHELIL A-A’BALE \ndescendant of healthy and perfectly \nوَ الثَّابِتِ الْقَدَمِ عَلٰی زَحَالِیْفِہَا فِی الزَّمَنِ الْاَوَّلِ \nWAS SAABETIL QADAME A’LAA ZAHAALEEFEHAA FIZ ZAMANIL AWWAL \nformed ancestors, steadfast in the early turbulent years.\nوَ عَلٰی آلِہِ الْاَخْیَارِ الْمُصْطَفِیْنَ الْاَبْرَارِ \nWA A’LAA AALEHIL AKHYAARIL MUSTAFAYNIL ABRAAR.\nAnd also bless his select, elite and pious descendents. \nوَ افْتَحِ اللّٰہْمَّ لَنَا مَصَارِیْعَ الصَّبَاحِ بِمَفَاتِیْحِ الرَّحْمَۃِ وَ الْفَلاَحِ \nWAF-TAHIL LAAHUMMA LANAA MASAAREE-A’S SABAAHE BEMAFAATEEHAR RAHMATE WAL-FALAAHE \nO Allah! Make the daybreak bring mercy and welfare from Thee unto us. \nوَ الْبِسْمِ اللّٰہُمَّ مِنْ اَفْضَلِ خِلَعِ الْہِدَایَۃِ وَ الصَّلاَحِ \nWAL-BISMIL LAAHUMMA MIN AFZALE KHELA-I’L HEDAAYATE WAS-SALAAHE \nO Allah! Make me ready for a life, full of goodness and true guidance. \nوَ اغْرِسِ اللّٰہُمَّ بِعَظْمَتِكَ فِيْ شِرْبِ جَنَانِيْ یَنَابِیْعَ الْخُشُوْعِ \nWAGHRESIL LAAHUMMA BE-A’ZMATEKA FEE SHIRBE JANAANEE YANAABEE-A’L KHOSHOO-E’ \nO Allah! For the sake of Thy greatness, let me drink, to the full satisfaction of my heart, from the delightful spring of submissiveness.\nوَاجْرِ اَللّٰہُمَّ لِہَیْبَتِكَ مِنْ اٰمَاقِیْ زَفَرَاتِ الدُّمُوْعِ \nWAJRIL LAAHUMMA LEHAYBATEKA MIN AAMAAQEE ZAFARAATID DOMOO-E’ \nO Allah! Make my eyes weep in fear of Thy awe-inspiring majesty.\nوَ اَدِّبِ اللّٰہُمَّ نَزَقَ الْخُرْقِ مِنِّیْ بِاَزِمَّۃِ الْقُنُوْعِ \nWA ADDEBIL LAAHUMMA NAZAQAL KHURQE MINNEE BE-AZIMMATIL QONOO-E’. \nO Allah! Let me get rid of whimsical carelessness and misplaced harshness by exercising self-control.\nاِلٰہِیْ اِنْ لَّمْ تَبْتَدِئْنِیْ الرَّحْمَۃُ مِنْكَ بِحُسْنِ التَّوْفِیْقِ \nELAAHI ILLAM TABTADEA-NIR RAHMATO MINKA BEHUSNIT TAWFEEQE \nO Allah! If Thou does not mercifully and favourably raise my spirits, \nفَمَنِ السَّالِكُ بِیْ اِلَیْكَ فِيْ وَاضِحِ الطَّرِیْقِ \nFAMANIS SAALEKO BEE ELAYKA FEE WAAZEHIT TAREEQE \nwho will lead me to the evidently true path? \nوَ اِنْ اَسْلَمَتْنِيْ اَنَاتُكَ لِقَائِدِ الْاَمَلِ وَ الْمُنٰی \nWA IN ASLAMATNEE ANAATOKA LEQAAEDIL AMALE WAL MONAA \nIf Thy indulgence encourages me to run after the (vain) hopes and desires, \nفَمَنِ الْمُقِیْلُ عَثَرَاتِيْ مِنْ كَبَوَاتِ الْہَوٰی \nFAMANIL MOQEELO A’SARATEE MIN KABAWAATIL HAWAA \nwho will make me stand again on the ground after I tumble into the deep well of sinful passions? \nوَ اِنْ خَذَلَنِيْ نَصْرُكَ عِنْدَ مُحَارَبَۃِ النَّفْسِ وَ الشَّیْطَانِ \nWA IN KHAZALANEE NASROKA I’NDA MOHAARABATIN NAFSE WASH-SHAYTAANE \nIf Thou hold back Thy help, when my soul is in the tug-of-war with Shaitan, \nفَقَدْ وَكَلَنِيْ خِذْلَانُكَ اِلٰی حَیْثُ النَّصَبِ وَ الْحِرْمَانِ \nFAQAD WAKALANEE KHIZLAANOKA ELAA HAYSUN NASABE WALHIRMAAN.\nthen certainly painful frustration is my fate.\nاِلٰہِیْ اَتَرَانِیْ مَا اَتَیْتُكَ اِلَّا مِنْ حَیْثُ الْآمَالِ اَمْ عَلِقْتُ بِاَطْرَافِ حِبَالِكَ \nELAAHI A-TARAANEE MAA ATAYTOKA ILLAA MIN HAYSUL AAMAALE AM A’LIQTO BE-ATRAAFE HEBAALEKA \nMy Allah! If it is so that my selfish desires made me turn to Thee, or that I had to hold fast Thy cause, \nاِلَّا حِیْنَ بَاعَدَتْنِیْ ذُنُوْبِیْ عَنْ دَارِ الْوِصَالِ فَبِئْسَ الْمَطِیَّۃُ \nILLAA HEENA BAA-A’DATNEE ZONOOBEE A’N DAARIL WESAALE FA-BEA-SAL MATIYYATUL \nonly after my sins had cut off the cord of Thy friendship, then (certainly) my heart and soul went with the evil current of vain desires. \nالَّتِیْ امْتَطَتْ نَفْسِيْ مِنْ ہَوَاہَا فَوَاہًا لَہَا لِمَا سَوَّلَتْ لَہَا ظُنُوْنُہَا وَمُنَاہَا \nLATIM TA-TAT NAFSEE MIN HAWAAHAA FAWAAHAN LAHAA LEMAA SAWWALAT LAHAA ZONOONOHAA WA MONAAHAA \nFie upon the fanciful and aimless drift of petty imagination, riding on suspicious and doubtful hopes! \nوَ تَبًّا لَہَا لِجُرْأَتِہَا عَلٰی سَیِّدِہَا وَ مَوْلاَہَا اِلٰہِیْ قَرَعْتُ بَابَ رَحْمَتِكَ \nWA TABBAN LAHAA LEJURATEHAA A’LAA SAYYEDEHAA WA MAWLAAHAA ELAAHI QARA’TO BAABA RAHMATEKA\nA decisive blow and death to the insolent disrespectful-ness shown to the Lord and Master! My Allah! I hopefully knocked at the door of Thy mercy.\nبِیَدِ رَجَآئِیْ وَ ہَرَبْتُ اِلَیْكَ لَاجِئًا مِنْ فَرْطِ اَہْوَائِیْ وَ عَلَّقْتُ بِاَطْرَافِ \nBEYADE RAJAAA-EE WA HARABTO ELAYKA LAAJEAN MIN FARTE AHWAA-EE WA A’LLIQTO BE-ATRAAFE\nRunning away from the in-tense pressures of mounting passions I had come to Thee to hold fast Thy cord, \nحِبَالِكَ اَنَمِلَ وَلاَئِيْ فَاصْفَحِ اللّٰہُمَّ عَمَّا كَانَ اَجْرَمْتُہٗ مِنْ زَلَلِیْ وَ خَطَائِیْ \nHEBAALEKA ANAMELA WALAAEE FAS-FAHIL LAAHUMMA A’MMAA KAANA AJRAMTOHU MIN ZALALEE WA KHATAA-EE \nsincerely and affectionately. So O my Allah, forgive my sins of omission and commission and lift up \nوَ اَقِلْنِیْ مِنْ صَرْعَۃِ رِدَائِیْ فَاِنَكَ سَیِّدِیْ وَ مَوْلاَيَ وَ مُعْتَمَدِیْ \nWA AQILNEE MIN SAR-A’TE REDAA-EE FA-INNAKA SAYYEDEE WA MAWLAAYA WA MOA’TAMADEE \nand carry me out of the disgraceful pit of wickedness, Thou art my Lord and Master, my trust \nوَ رَجَائِیْ وَ غَایَۃَ مُنَايَ فِیْ مُنْقَلَبِیْ وَ مَثْوَايَ \nWA RAJAA-EE WA GHAAYATA MONAAYA FEE MUNQALABEE WA MASWAAYA. \nand hope. Thou art the ultimate purpose of my search and desire whether in transit or at the destination.\nاِلٰہِیْ كَیْفَ تَطْرُدُ مِسْكِیْنًا اِلْتَجَاَ اِلَیْكَ مِنَ الذُّنُوْبِ ہَارِبًا \nELAAHEE KAYFA TAT-RODO MISKEENAN ILTAJA-A ELAYKA MENAZ ZONOOBE HAAREBAN \nMy Allah! Will Thou turn out a destitute, who is running away from sinful life to take refuge under Thy protection? \nاَمْ كَیْفَ تُخَیِّبُ مُسْتَرْشِدًا قَصَدَ اِلٰی جَنَابِكَ سَاعِیًا \nAM KAYFA TOKAYYEBO MUSTARSHEDAN QASADA ELAA JANAABEKA SAA-E’YAN \nOr will Thou disappoint him, who, in search of truth, has eagerly come to Thee? \nاَمْ كَیْفَ تَرُدُّ ظَمْآنَ وَرَدَ اِلٰی حِیَاضِكَ شَارِبًا كَلَّا وَ حِیَاضُكَ مُتْرَعَۃٌ \nAM KAYFA TARUDDA ZAM-A’AANA WARADA ELAA HEYAAZEKA SHAAREBAA KALLAA WA HEYAAZOKA MUTRA-A’TUN \nOr will Thou cut out Thy mainstream (of mercy) for a thirster, who is longing for a saturating fill? No! By no means. Thy reservoir is full to the brim, \nفِيْ ضَنْكِ الْمَحُوْلِ وَ بَابُكَ مَفْتُوْحٌ لِلطَّلَبِ وَالْوُغُوْلِ وَ اَنْتَ غَایَۃَ الْمَسْئُوْلِ \nFEE ZANKIL MAHOOLE WA BAABOKA MAFTOOHUN LITTALABE WAL-WAGHOOLE WA ANTA GHAAYATAL MAS-OOLE \noverflowing. Thou has kept open Thy doorway (access) for the needy and the fugitive. Thou art the Ultimate reference for making requests, \nوَ نِہَایَۃَ الْمَامُوْلِ اِلٰہِیْ ہٰذِہٖ اَزِمَّۃُ نَفْسِیْ عَقَلْتُہَا بِعِقَالِ مَشِیَّتِكَ \nWA NEHAAYATAL MAAMOOL. ELAAHEE HAAZEHI AZIMMATO NAFSEE A’QALTOHAA BE-E’QAALE MASHIYYATEKA \nThe last resort of beseechers. O Allah, my heart and soul are devotedly tied up with the wisdom of Thy will; \nوَ ہٰذِہٖ اَعْبَآءُ ذُنُوْبِیْ دَرَاْتُہَا بِرَافَتِكَ وَ رَحْمَتِكَ وَ ہٰذِہٖ اَہْوَائِیْ الْمُضِلَّۃُ \nWA HAAZEHI A-A’BAAA-O ZONOOBEE DARAATOHAA BE-RAAFATEKA WA RAHMATEKA WA HAAZEHI AHWAA-IL MOZILLATO \nand the weight of my sins has been taken off through forgiveness and mercy; \nوَكَلْتُہَا اِلٰی جَنَابِ لُطْفِكَ وَ رَافَتِكَ فَاجْعَلِ اللّٰہُمَّ صَبَاحِیْ ہٰذَا نَازِلًا \nWAKALTOHAA ELAA JANAABE LUTFEKA WA RAAFATEKA FAJ-A’LIL LAAHUMMA SABAAHEE HAAZAA NAAZELAN \nand I have done with my wayward desires on account of Thy kindness and compassion. So my Allah! Make this daybreak bring light of guidance, \nعَلَیَّ بِضِیَآءِ الْہُدٰی وَ السَّلاَمَۃِ فِيْ الدِّیْنِ وَ الدُّنْیَا \nA’LAYYA BE-ZEYAA-IL HODAA WAS SALAAMATE FID-DEENE WAD-DUNYAA \npeace in this world, and salvation in the Hereafter, for me. \nوَ مَسَائِیْ جُنَّۃَ مِنْ كَیْدِ الْاَعْدَاءِ وَ وِقَایَۃً مِنْ مُرْدِیَاتِ الْہَوٰی \nWA MASAA-EE JUNNATA MIN KAYDIL A-A’DAA-E WA WEQAA-YATAN MIN MURDEYAATIL HAWAA \nLet the night work as a shield against the decietful enemies, and keep me safe from the onslaught of my own vain desires. \nاِنَكَ قَادِرٌ عَلٰی مَا تَشَآءُ تُؤْتِی الْمُلْكَ مَنْ تَشَآءُ \nINNAKA QAADERUN A’LAA MAA TASHAA-O TOA-TIL MULKA MAN TASHAAA-O \nVerily, Thou does what Thou wills, gives sovereignty unto whom Thou wills, \nوَ تَنْزِعُ الْمُلْكَ مِمَّنْ تَشَآءُ وَ تُعِزُّ مَنْ تَشَآءُ وَ تُذِلُّ مَنْ تَشَآءُ \nWA TANZE-U’L MULKA MIMMAN TASHAAA-O WA TO-I’ZZO MAN TASHAAA-O WA TOZILLO MAN TASHAAA-O \nand with-drawns sovereignty from whom Thou wills; Thou exalts whom Thou wills and humbles whom Thou wills. \nبِیَدِكَ الْخَیْرُ اِنَّكَ عَلٰی كُلِّ شَیْءٍ قَدِیْرٌ تُوْلِجُ اللَّیْلَ فِیْ النَّہَارِ \nBEYADEKAL KHAYRO INNAKA A’LAA KULLE SHAY-IN QADEER TOOLEJUL LAYLA FIN NAHAARE \nIn Thy hand is the good. Verily Thou art able to do all things. Thou causes the night to pass into the day, \nوَ تُوْلِجُ النَّہَارَ فِی اللَّیْلِ وَ تُخْرِجُ الْحَيَّ مِنَ الْمَیِّتِ وَ تُخْرِجُ المَیِّتَ مِنَ الْحَيِّ \nWA TOOLEJUN NAHAARA FIL LAYLE WA TUKHREJUL HAYYA MENAL MAYYETE WA TUKHREJUL MAYYETA MENAL HAYYE \nand Thou causes the day to pass into the night, and Thou brings forth the living from the dead, and Thou brings forth the dead from the living, \nوَ تَرْزُقُ مَنْ تَشَآءُ بِغَیْرِ حِسَابٍ لَآ اِلٰہَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ سُبْحَانَكَ اللّٰہُم \nWA TARZOQO MAN TASHAAA-O BE-GHAYRE HESAAB LAA ELAAHA ILLAA ANTA SUBHAANAKA ALLAAHUMMA\nand Thou gives sustenance to whom Thou chooses, without measure. There is no god except Thou. Glory be to Thee O Allah \nوَ بِحَمْدِكَ مَنْ ذَا یَعْلَمُ قُدْرَتَكَ فَلاَ یَخَافُكَ وَ مَنْ ذَا یَعْلَمُ مَا آنْتَ \nWA BEHAMDEKA MAN ZAA YA’LAMO QUDRATAKA FALAA YAKHAAFOKA WA MAN ZAA YA’LAMO MAA ANTA \nand praise be to Thee! Who is aware of Thy power without fearing Thee? Who knows who Thou art without overawed by Thee? \nفَلاَ یَہَابُكَ اَلَّفْتَ بِقُدْرَتِكَ الْفِرَقَ وَ فَلَقْتَ بِلُطْفِكَ الْفَلَقَ وَ نَوَّرْتَ بِكَرَمِكَ \nFALAA YAHAABOKA ALLAFTA BEQUDRATEKAL FERAQA WA FALAQTA BELUTFEKAL FALAQA WA NAWWARTA BEKARAMEKA \nWith Thy power Thou gathered around discord and strife; and mercifully caused the dawn to break forth, and generously illuminated the dark nights. \nدَیَاجِيَّ الْغَسَقِ وَ اَنْہَرْتَ الْمِیَاہَ مِنَ الصُّمِّ الصَّیَاخِیْدِ عَذْبًا وَّ اُجَاجًا \nDAYAAJIYYAL GHASAQE WA ANHARTAL MEYAAHA MENAS SUMMIS SAYAAKHEEDE A’ZBANW WA OJAAJANW \nIt is Thou Who brings forth sweet as well as sour springs of water from the heart of hard solid rocks, and makes clouds pour down heavy rains, \nوَّ اَنْزَلْتَ مِنَ الْمُعْصِرَاتِ مَآءً ثَجَّاجًا وَ جَعَلْتَ الشَّمْسَ وَالْقَمَرَ لِلْبَرِیَّۃِ سِرَاجًا وَّ ہَّاجًا \nWA ANZALTA MENAL MOA’SERAATE MAAA-AN SAJJAAJAN WA JA-A’LTASH SHAMSA WAL-QAMARA LILBARIYYATE SERAAJANW WAHHAAJAA \nand appointed the luminous sun and the bright moon, like burning lamps, to fill the earth with brilliant light \nمِنْ غَیْرِ اَنْ تُمَارِسَ فِیْمَا ابْتَدَاْتَ بِہٖ لُغُوْبًا وَّلَا عِلاَجًا فَیَا مَنْ تَوَحَّدَ بِالْعِزِّ وَ الْبَقَآءِ \nMIN GHAYRE AN TOMAARESA FEEMAB TADAATA BEHI LOGHOOBANW WA LAA E’LAAJAN FAYAA MAN TAWAHHADA BIL-I’ZZE WAL-BAQAAA-E \nWhatever Thou did, Thou did without effort, or experiment. O He Who is unique in His glory and everlasting continuity; \nوَ قَہَرَ عِبَادَہٗ بِالْمَوْتِ وَ الْفَنَآءِ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ آلِہٖ الْاَتَقِیَآءِ \nWA QAHARA E’BAADAHU BIL-MAWTE WAL-FANAAA-E SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALEHIL ATQEYAAA-E \nand has total control over His creation through death and mortality; send blessings on Muhammad and on his pure and pious descendents, \nوَ اسْمَعْ نِدَآئِيْ وَ اسْتَجِبْ دُعَآئِيْ وَ اَہْلِكَ اَعْدَآئِيْ وَ حَقِّقْ بِفَضْلِكَ آمَالِيْ \nWAS-MA’ NEDAAA-EE WASTAJIB DO-A’AA-EE WA AHLIK A-A’DAA-EE WA HAQQIQ BE-FAZLEKA AAMAALEE \nand listen to and accept my supplication, answer my call and kindly fulfil my desires \nوَ رَجَآئِيْ یَا خَیْرَ مَنْ دُعِیَ لِكَشْفِ الضُّرِّ وَ الْمَامُوْلِ لِكُلِّ عُسْرٍ وَ یُسْرٍ \nWA RAJAA-EE YAA KHAYRA MAN DO-E’YA LE-KASHFIZ ZURRE WAL-MAAMOOLE LEKULLE U’SRIN WA YUSRIN \nand expectations. O the Best of those who are invoked, for elimination of distress, fulfilment of hopes, and removal of all difficulties. \nبِكَ اَنْزَلْتُ حَاجَتِیْ فَلاَ تَرُدَّنِیْ مِنْ سَنِیِّ مَوَاہِبِكَ خَآئِبًا یَا كَرِیْمُ یَا كَرِیْمُ یَا كَرِیْمُ \nBEKA ANZALTO HAAJATEE FALAA TARUDDANEE MIN SANIYYE MAWAAHEBEKA KHAAA-EBAN YAA KAREEMO YAA KAREEMO YAA KAREEMO \nI put up my petition. So, do not send me away disappointed, with frustration of not getting Thy wonderful gifts. O Generous! O Generous! O Generous! So be it.  Through Thy mercy,\nبِرَحْمَتِكَ یَاآرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِیْنَ وَ صَلَّی اﷲُ عَلٰی خَیْرِ خَلْقِہٖ مُحَمَّدٍ \nBE-RAHMATEKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEEN WA SALLAL LAAHO A’LAA KHAYRE KHALQEHI MOHAMMADIN \nO the Most Merciful. Send Blessings on our Master and Prophet. Muhammad, \nوَ آلِہٖ اَجْمَعِیْنَ.\nWA AALEHI AJMA-E’EN.\nand his descendents, one and all.\nRecite the following in Sajdah:\nاِلٰہِیْ قَلْبِیْ مَحْجُوْبٌ وَّ نَفْسِیْ مَعْیُوْبٌ وَّ عَقْلِیْ مَغْلُوْبٌ وَّ ہَوَآئِیْ غَالِبٌ \nELAAHEE QALBEE MAHJOOBUNW WA NAFSEE MA’YOOBUNW WA AQLEE MAGHLOOBUNW WA HAWAAA-EE GHAALEBUNW \nO Allah! I feel ashamed. I am confused. My conscience is guilty there is no end to desires, \nوَّ طَاعَتِیْ قَلِیْلٌ وَّ مَعْصِیَتِیْ كَثِیْرٌ وَّ لِسَانِیْ مُقِرٌّ بِالذُّنُوْبِ \nWA TAA-A’TEE QALEELUNW WA MA’SEYATEE KASEERUNW WA LESAANEE MOQIRRUN BIZ-ZONOOBE \n(but) obedience is missing; and sins are many. I humbly confess my misconduct, and admit my drawbacks.\nفَكَیْفَ حِیْلَتِیْ یَا سَتَّارَا الْعُیُوْبِ وَ یَا عَلاَّمَ الْغُیُوْبِ وَ یَا كَاشِفَ الْكُرُوْبِ \nFAKAYFA HEELATEE YAA SATTAARAL O’OYOOBE WA YAA A’LLAAMAL GHOYOOBE WA YAA KAASHEFAL KOROOBE \nSo there is no excuse, O Knower of the Unseen. O Concealer of errors, \nاِغْفِرْ ذُنُوْبِیْ كُلَّہَا بِحُرْمَۃِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nIGHFIR ZONOOBEE KULLAHAA BEHURMATE MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nO Forgiver of sins, forgive my sins. O Forgiver, protect me. O Protector for the sake of Muhammad and his pure progeny, \nیَا غَفَّارُ یَا غَفَّارُ یَا غَفَّارُ بِرَحْمَتِكَ یَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِیْنَ.\nYAA GHAFFAARO YAA GHAFFAARO YAA GHAFFAARO BERAHMATEKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEEN.\nthrough Thy mercy, O the Most Merciful. "
}
